I"�.<p>Recognizing an optimizer’s name, implementing its update rule, and explaining why a training run diverged are different skills. AI preparation gets more useful when the exercise matches the skill you need to build.</p>

<p>Deep-ML, TensorTonic, LeetGPU, and Context Window Prep provide four useful starting points: implement algorithms, assemble model components, optimize kernels, and reason through technical scenarios. The wider landscape adds specialized practice in library fluency, LLM applications, system design, and data analysis.</p>

